                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V_p
              as claimed.
            %p
              The rest follows from the simple fact that we can also define
              %math#mathml_26ecd24cbcd4290244c987e7239084dea2eb07d3_64.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
